repository-code: "https://github.com/marcusdavidwebb/SubGaussianTailBounds"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary proof, exact rational arithmetic certificates and conditional
  Lean analytic verification for Sharp tail bounds for the extreme singular
  values of sub-Gaussian matrices, by Marcus Webb and Morgan Lynch-Davies.
  The paper is in preparation and no public version is currently available.
  Marcus Webb is the sole author of the supplementary document, which discloses
  its AI generation and human responsibility. Identify the repository commit or
  release used independently of the paper's publication status.
